WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.620
Did you know that the demon king&nbsp;
Muzan was married five times? Or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:09.060
that Tanjiro is one of only three&nbsp;
people confirmed to have seen the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:14.100
legendary Blue Spider Lily? Or that two&nbsp;
of the Hashira secretly loved each other?

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:18.660
And ironically one half of that secret&nbsp;
relationship is the Love Hashira, Mitsuri&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:23.700
Kanroji. But what’s maybe even more incredible is&nbsp;
that she is actually the only Hashira who didn’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:29.400
have some sort of horribly traumatic childhood.&nbsp;
That’s because she grew up in a normal family&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:35.160
with five kids where her biggest problem was that&nbsp;
her ridiculous physical strength kept scaring away&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:39.780
potential husbands. And besides her strength, her&nbsp;
pink hair was also a real issue with the guys. But&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:45.120
I think it’s kinda cool because she is actually&nbsp;
the only anime girl I know of that has a reason&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:52.080
for her wacky hair color. That’s because hers&nbsp;
only turned this bright pink because she ate way,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:57.180
way too much sakura mochi. All this led to&nbsp;
Mitsuri being pretty depressed, however,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.180 --> 00:01:01.440
she decided she didn’t want to fake who&nbsp;
she was to find a husband so she joined&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:05.880
the demon slayer corps after the leader told&nbsp;
her that she should embrace her true abilities.

00:01:05.880 --> 00:01:09.600
Which is when the real drama starts&nbsp;
because she secretly fell in love&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:12.360
with one of the other Hashira,&nbsp;
who we’ll talk about later on.

00:01:13.680 --> 00:01:19.620
Continuing with the anime characters, the&nbsp;
Upper Moon Six demons Daki and Gyutaro were&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.620 --> 00:01:24.780
not nearly as fortunate growing up as Mitsuri.&nbsp;
These two were born to a prostitute mother,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:29.820
and she was such a terrible mom that she&nbsp;
actually tried to kill both of them. Their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:34.320
mom particularly was jealous of Daki and&nbsp;
even tried to cut off her beautiful hair,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:40.740
but Gyutaro went on a rampage to save his sister.&nbsp;
However, Gyutaro was not as fortunate in the looks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:46.620
department, and he was constantly mocked for his&nbsp;
appearance, voice, and his poor hygiene. Which&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:52.380
I mean come on, who wouldn’t have bad teeth if&nbsp;
they were forced to eat bugs and rats to survive.

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:56.760
Gyutaro couldn’t always protect Daki&nbsp;
though because years later when she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.760 --> 00:02:02.220
was a successful&nbsp;Oiran, she stabbed a samurai&nbsp;
for mocking her brother. This made the samurai&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:07.620
furious, and he tied her up and literally&nbsp;
burned her alive. Gyutaro barely managed to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.620 --> 00:02:13.500
save her and he killed the samurai as revenge.&nbsp;
And if that wasn’t bad enough no one would even&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:19.020
help the siblings until the Upper Rank demon&nbsp;
Doma found them and turned them into demons.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:19.020 --> 00:02:24.000
And that’s how the pair came to terrorize&nbsp;
the Entertainment district for centuries.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:29.880
However there is another super powerful, early&nbsp;
story character who I bet you didn’t know was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:34.980
mocked for his looks. This is Sakonji&nbsp;
Urokodaki, the former Water Hashira who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.980 --> 00:02:39.780
first trained Tanjiro and the current Water&nbsp;
Hashira, Giyu. Among his many other feats,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.780 --> 00:02:44.400
Urokodaki is famous for capturing and&nbsp;
imprisoning the Hand Demon that was the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:49.140
main enemy during Tanjiro’s test to become a&nbsp;
demon slayer. But despite being crazy strong,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:54.180
he apparently has a soft side because demons&nbsp;
used to make fun of his gentle features,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:54.180 --> 00:02:59.460
and this bothered him SO much that he started&nbsp;
wearing these fox masks to hide his face.

00:02:59.460 --> 00:03:03.960
And of course you might recognize these masks&nbsp;
because they were also worn by these spirits,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:10.020
Makomo and Sabito. These two were orphans&nbsp;
who were trained by Urokodaki. Makomo&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:14.460
lived sometime before Sabito, and when&nbsp;
she went for her Final Selection test,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:20.820
she was killed by the hand demon. The same is&nbsp;
true for Sabito, who was also killed by this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:20.820 --> 00:03:26.040
ugly monstrosity. Though apparently Sabito&nbsp;
took the test at the same time as Giyu and he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:30.660
actually saved Giyu during their week on the&nbsp;
mountain. But because of their failures both&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:30.660 --> 00:03:34.980
of these two became spirits who lived on the&nbsp;
mountain where they helped Tanjiro to train.

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:39.600
Plus as I already mentioned, their killer&nbsp;
was this disgusting figure who was captured&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:39.600 --> 00:03:43.920
and imprisoned by Urokodaki, but we&nbsp;
also know that the very first person&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:48.660
this demon killed was his older brother&nbsp;
after he was first turned into a demon.

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:55.860
That’s nowhere near as insane as the Drum demon’s&nbsp;
backstory though because this demon used to be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:55.860 --> 00:04:01.440
a member of the Twelve Kizuki, which are the&nbsp;
twelve strongest demons in the world. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:04.860
he somehow lost his ability to&nbsp;
grow stronger from eating humans,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.860 --> 00:04:09.840
so the demon king Muzan took away his&nbsp;
position. Ever since then the drum demon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:12.480
has been obsessed with growing&nbsp;
stronger to regain his position.

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:18.960
Another character who lost something important&nbsp;
is this guy – actually wait, pretty much every&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:26.040
character in this story has lost someone important&nbsp;
to them. Anyway, this is Shinjuro Rengoku, who is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:30.240
the father of the Flame Hashira from the&nbsp;
Mugen Train arc. He was married to Ruka,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:35.460
and also had another son named Shenjuro.&nbsp;
Shinjuro used to be the former flame hashira,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:40.860
and even saved this guy from his super tragic&nbsp;
past which we’ll discuss more later on.

00:04:40.860 --> 00:04:45.780
But Shinjuro became a deadbeat&nbsp;
dad after his wife died. In fact,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:45.780 --> 00:04:51.660
he was so torn up about his wife’s death that&nbsp;
when he encountered a lower rank demon, he took&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:51.660 --> 00:04:57.120
out his anger by cutting it up over and over&nbsp;
again, but never actually killing the monster.

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:03.960
Now even though demons are mostly all awful&nbsp;
monsters, that doesn’t mean that they can’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:03.960 --> 00:05:11.040
have some serious trauma of their own. This is&nbsp;
perfectly shown by the Lower Moon Five demon,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:16.080
Rui, who was actually born to a normal&nbsp;
family with parents who loved him. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:20.820
was a pretty weak child though, so when&nbsp;
Muzan offered to make him a strong demon,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:26.520
he immediately accepted the offer. But after&nbsp;
killing a household servant, Rui’s parent’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:26.520 --> 00:05:31.440
tried to kill him because they didn’t want him&nbsp;
to become a monster. Whoops, too late for that.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:31.440 --> 00:05:37.680
So Rui actually killed his beloved parents and&nbsp;
then spent the next twenty years unsuccessfully&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:37.680 --> 00:05:43.080
trying to recreate that special family vibe with&nbsp;
demons that he transformed into fellow spiders.

00:05:43.080 --> 00:05:49.920
And if you think that is twisted, then just&nbsp;
wait until you hear about Enmu’s disturbing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:49.920 --> 00:05:55.980
past. When he was a human he could actually not&nbsp;
tell the difference from dreams or reality. Which&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:55.980 --> 00:06:01.320
sounds interesting, but as an adult this&nbsp;
led him to pretend to be a doctor and he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:06.660
would tell patients that they were healed&nbsp;
even though they were about to die. What a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:06.660 --> 00:06:10.980
crazy messed up thing to do. But that’s&nbsp;
not even the worst part because one day&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:10.980 --> 00:06:15.480
the demon king was literally in the middle of&nbsp;
eating Enmu, but instead of being terrified&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:22.200
he actually praised Muzan which somehow&nbsp;
convinced him to turn Enmu into a demon.

00:06:23.220 --> 00:06:29.100
Wow, I never actually realized how messed up&nbsp;
backstories in demon slayer are until making&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:29.100 --> 00:06:34.800
this video. In fact the standard backstory for&nbsp;
a character is basically just “family killed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:34.800 --> 00:06:39.960
by demons”, which is true for these three&nbsp;
little helpers from the Butterfly Mansion,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:45.060
whose names are Sumi, Kiyo, and Naho.&nbsp;
And the same can be said for Aoi,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:45.060 --> 00:06:49.860
however she has a bit more to her backstory&nbsp;
because at one point she was actually able to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:49.860 --> 00:06:54.720
pass the test to become a demon slayer,&nbsp;
although she claims it was pure luck.

00:06:54.720 --> 00:07:00.060
And each of these characters were taken&nbsp;
in by the Flower Hashira, Shinobu Kocho,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:06.300
whose parents were – you guessed it – also killed&nbsp;
by demons. But she and her sister were actually&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:06.300 --> 00:07:11.880
saved by the Stone Hashira, who has literally&nbsp;
one of the most heroic backstories in the manga&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:11.880 --> 00:07:16.800
which we’ll discuss later on. But one other fact&nbsp;
about Shinobi that you may not know is that her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:16.800 --> 00:07:21.960
uniform was actually supposed to be incredibly&nbsp;
revealing - just like Mitsuri’s - however,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:27.180
she immediately burned the open-chested&nbsp;
jacket and requested a fully buttoned one.

00:07:27.180 --> 00:07:31.140
Another mind-blowing fact about Shinobu’s past&nbsp;
is that she became the head of the butterfly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:31.140 --> 00:07:39.180
mansion at just 14 years old! That’s wild, I&nbsp;
mean kids in this world basically seem like&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:45.000
adults once they hit 10. But Shinobu only&nbsp;
got this role because her older sister,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:49.740
Kanae, died in a battle against the Upper&nbsp;
Rank demon, Doma. But before she died,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:49.740 --> 00:07:54.360
Kanae and Shinobu both rescued this&nbsp;
young girl from her terrible childhood.

00:07:54.360 --> 00:08:00.720
But it turns out being a slave wasn’t even&nbsp;
the worst part of Kanao Tsuyuri’s backstory.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:00.720 --> 00:08:04.500
That’s because she grew up with parents&nbsp;
who were so abusive that she literally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:11.100
had a mental breakdown and repressed all of her&nbsp;
emotions. Her parents then sold her into slavery,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:11.100 --> 00:08:15.360
where she was rescued by the Kocho sisters.&nbsp;
They took her to the butterfly mansion and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:20.460
she eventually learned Flower breathing from&nbsp;
just watching Shinobu and Kanea. This made&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:20.460 --> 00:08:25.320
her so strong that she took the Final Selection&nbsp;
test without her adoptive sisters’ permission.

00:08:25.320 --> 00:08:28.560
And while Kanao’s traumatic&nbsp;
past might break your heart,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:29.580 --> 00:08:36.900
no one should cry over this sickening liar right&nbsp;
here. This is the Upper Rank 4 demon Hantengu,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:36.900 --> 00:08:42.300
who was such a frequent liar during his human&nbsp;
life that he would commit horrible crimes and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:42.300 --> 00:08:47.700
then cry and scream that he was innocent.&nbsp;
His mind was even so twisted that he was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:47.700 --> 00:08:52.020
married multiple times but would always&nbsp;
end up killing his own family. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:52.020 --> 00:08:57.420
he was eventually caught and sentenced to&nbsp;
death, only to be turned into a demon by Muzan.

00:09:02.280 --> 00:09:07.260
While all of that is pretty messed up, his partner&nbsp;
in the attack on the swordsmith village is even&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:07.260 --> 00:09:12.120
more disturbing. That’s because as a child,&nbsp;
Gyokko’s parents drowned while out fishing at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:12.120 --> 00:09:17.400
sea. Eventually he saw their bodies washed up on&nbsp;
shore and developed a sickening fascination with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:17.400 --> 00:09:25.560
corpses and in particular dead fish. This led his&nbsp;
village to believe he had gone insane. Eventually,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:25.560 --> 00:09:30.540
Gyokko killed another kid who was making fun&nbsp;
of him. However, the murdered kid’s parents&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:34.020
got their revenge by stabbing Gyokko. But&nbsp;
unfortunately for the rest of the world,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:34.020 --> 00:09:40.140
he somehow managed to survive until&nbsp;
he was turned into a demon by Muzan.

00:09:40.140 --> 00:09:45.720
Which of course meant that he could continue&nbsp;
making his creepy body art until he was defeated&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:45.720 --> 00:09:50.520
by the Mist Hashira, Muicihiro Tokito.&nbsp;
But like pretty much all the Hashira,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:57.240
his childhood was awfully tragic. Muichiro and his&nbsp;
twin brother were born into a woodcutting family,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:57.240 --> 00:10:03.840
but his mom died from illness and his father&nbsp;
fell off a cliff. Wow, there’s a new way to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:03.840 --> 00:10:08.700
die in the story. Their parents’ deaths left&nbsp;
the twins to survive on their own. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:08.700 --> 00:10:13.740
the leader of the demon slayers actually tried&nbsp;
to recruit the boys many times, but Muichiro’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:13.740 --> 00:10:19.020
brother always turned them down. So they continued&nbsp;
their life until a demon came and attacked them,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:19.020 --> 00:10:25.080
leaving Muichiro’s brother dead. Muichiro managed&nbsp;
to kill the demon, but seeing his brother die&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:25.080 --> 00:10:30.540
literally broke his mind and he lost all of his&nbsp;
memories and personality. Luckily he was found&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:30.540 --> 00:10:35.040
by the demon slayers, and after recovering&nbsp;
he became a Hashira in the insanely short&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:41.580
time of two months. Which may sound crazy&nbsp;
but it actually makes sense considering he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:41.580 --> 00:10:46.020
has a super strong relative from the past who&nbsp;
we will talk about at the end of the video.

00:10:46.020 --> 00:10:52.020
But Muichiro is not the only descendant of a&nbsp;
crazy strong bloodline. That’s because this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:52.020 --> 00:10:58.740
flashy Hashira came from a legendary clan of&nbsp;
Shinobi. But as cool as that sounds, Tengen’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:58.740 --> 00:11:04.200
childhood was pretty awful. By the age of 15 he&nbsp;
is basically forced into getting married, which&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:10.260
I guess isn’t all bad when these three are your&nbsp;
wives, but the worst part is that he and his eight&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:10.260 --> 00:11:16.200
siblings were forced to face each other in death&nbsp;
matches until only the two strongest survived.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:21.600
However, when Tengen learned he was&nbsp;
actually killing his brothers and sisters,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:21.600 --> 00:11:27.420
he left the clan and never returned. And while he&nbsp;
sometimes thought about wiping out his terrible&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:27.420 --> 00:11:32.400
clan altogether, he could never bring himself&nbsp;
to kill his dad and only remaining brother.

00:11:32.400 --> 00:11:38.640
Which is honorable in its own way, but it’s&nbsp;
not the only broken brotherly bond in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:38.640 --> 00:11:44.040
story. Because Genya and his brother Sanemi&nbsp;
have actually never gotten along after their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:44.040 --> 00:11:49.020
tragic childhood. Their abusive father was&nbsp;
randomly stabbed by someone in the village&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:54.840
and their mom worked tirelessly to provide for&nbsp;
the family. That is until she was turned into a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:54.840 --> 00:12:00.000
demon and attacked her own family. All the kids&nbsp;
were killed except Genya and his older brother,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:04.560
who somehow managed to kill their demon&nbsp;
mom. However, young Genya panicked and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:04.560 --> 00:12:09.660
shouted at Sanemi for killing their mom,&nbsp;
and the two have never gotten along since.

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:13.260
Later both boys joined the demon&nbsp;
corps where Genya learned he cannot&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:13.260 --> 00:12:17.340
use breathing techniques, but he does&nbsp;
actually have the super rare ability to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:17.340 --> 00:12:21.240
consume demon flesh and gain some&nbsp;
demonic strength and healing.

00:12:21.240 --> 00:12:26.400
And Genya’s heroics during the swordsmith village&nbsp;
arc helped save everyone’s favorite swordsmith,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:31.620
Haganezuka. Apparently, his massive temper&nbsp;
tantrums have been an issue ever since he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:31.620 --> 00:12:35.280
was a kid, and he even caused his&nbsp;
parents to have mental breakdowns,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:35.280 --> 00:12:39.540
which resulted in Haganezuka&nbsp;
being raised by the village chief.

00:12:39.540 --> 00:12:45.720
Which based on all of the orphans there seem&nbsp;
to be in this story, it is a good thing there&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:45.720 --> 00:12:52.440
are so many old men willing to take these kids&nbsp;
in. Because even Zenitsu was not raised by his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:52.440 --> 00:12:57.480
parents. In fact, when he was on his own as a&nbsp;
kid he gave all his money to some random crush,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:57.480 --> 00:13:02.940
who then stole it and ran away with another&nbsp;
dude. Ah, poor guy. Lost it all for love. But&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:02.940 --> 00:13:08.760
This left Zenitsu in terrible debt until this&nbsp;
old man, Jigoro, took him in and trained him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:13.440
as a swordsman. However, Zenitsu was so scared&nbsp;
of training that one day he climbed a tree and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:13.440 --> 00:13:18.840
was then struck by lightning. Which permanently&nbsp;
changed his hair to its now familiar yellow.

00:13:18.840 --> 00:13:22.920
And while this made the Jigoro furious,&nbsp;
he still cared for Zenitsu like a son.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:22.920 --> 00:13:27.600
And this is a pretty cool trainer to&nbsp;
have, since he was a former Thunder&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:27.600 --> 00:13:33.540
Hashira who only retired when he lost his&nbsp;
leg during a battle when he was thirty-five.

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:37.860
One character who isn’t as cool is&nbsp;
the Temari demon from season one,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:37.860 --> 00:13:43.380
Susamaru, who apparently loved to play&nbsp;
with these hand balls even as a human.

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:47.820
Then we have Murata, who was one of the only&nbsp;
survivors of the spider demon attack on Mount&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:47.820 --> 00:13:53.040
Natagumo. Though apparently before becoming&nbsp;
a demon slayer a girl he liked complimented&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:53.040 --> 00:13:58.020
his hair, which is why he regularly grooms and&nbsp;
applies camellia oil to keep its silky look.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:58.020 --> 00:14:04.620
Nice to see that someone in this dangerous&nbsp;
world actually takes care of themselves.

00:14:04.620 --> 00:14:09.180
Next up is the man who saved Tanjiro, Zenitsu,&nbsp;
and Inosuke after the entertainment district&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:09.180 --> 00:14:14.460
arc. This is Goto, a member of the clean up&nbsp;
brigade, but did you know that he actually&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:14.460 --> 00:14:20.460
was worthy of becoming a demon slayer.&nbsp;
However, he chose to be one of the helpers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:24.840
instead? Hmm, I wonder why that was? Just like&nbsp;
I’m also wondering why you are not subscribed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:29.760
to the channel right now. So go ahead and click&nbsp;
that button for even more amazing anime content.

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:35.880
But now for one of the characters you would never&nbsp;
expect to play an important role. This is Yushiro,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:35.880 --> 00:14:41.760
who was once a sick boy under the care of the&nbsp;
gentle demon Tamayo. With Yushiro about to die,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:41.760 --> 00:14:46.680
Tamayo asked if he wanted to become a kind&nbsp;
demon just like herself so that he could&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:46.680 --> 00:14:52.740
live. He agreed, and has been at her side ever&nbsp;
since. However, he actually loves Tamayo deeply,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:52.740 --> 00:14:58.380
which may sound childish, but their bond actually&nbsp;
plays a huge role in the end of the story.

00:14:58.380 --> 00:15:03.360
Now at this point you might be wondering where&nbsp;
our main character is, but don’t worry because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:03.360 --> 00:15:09.060
we will be getting to him very soon. But first,&nbsp;
did you know that Tanjiro’s mother, Kie Kamado,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:09.060 --> 00:15:14.340
actually knows where to find the legendary&nbsp;
Blue Spider Lily flowers? We learned in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:14.340 --> 00:15:18.600
special fanbook number two that she knew&nbsp;
where to find the special flower and we&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:23.400
even see that Tanjiro had a flashback to the&nbsp;
flower during his fight with Rui. But that’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:28.380
not all we know about Kie because apparently&nbsp;
she once killed a boar with her incredibly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:28.380 --> 00:15:34.020
hard head. So it seems like we finally know&nbsp;
where Tanjiro got THAT special skill from.

00:15:34.980 --> 00:15:38.220
Of course that’s not the only&nbsp;
special skill in the family,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:38.220 --> 00:15:43.260
because Tanjiro’s father, Tanjuro, was&nbsp;
able to use the legendary Sun Breathing,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:43.260 --> 00:15:49.260
which of course has been passed down through their&nbsp;
family line. Tanjuro was also incredibly strong,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:49.260 --> 00:15:53.280
though he had no connection with the demon&nbsp;
slayer crops. However, there was an even&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:53.280 --> 00:15:58.080
more legendary ability that we learn later on&nbsp;
in the story, which he passed down to his son.

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:04.620
But first we have Tanjiro’s siblings,&nbsp;
Takeo, Hanako, Shigeru, and Rokuto,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:04.620 --> 00:16:07.980
who were all killed by Muzan. Of&nbsp;
course we can’t leave out Nezuko,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:12.420
who helped the family by going without new&nbsp;
clothes and other items to make sure that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:12.420 --> 00:16:16.860
the family had food. She was most often&nbsp;
helping her mother around their home.

00:16:16.860 --> 00:16:22.620
Which brings us to Tanjiro. And we’ve just&nbsp;
discussed his family and their humble upbringing,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:28.500
but there were a few other exciting events&nbsp;
throughout the early parts of his life. Like&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:33.660
when he got his famous scar after saving his&nbsp;
brother from a hot kettle. He also learned the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:33.660 --> 00:16:38.220
basics of Sun Breathing by watching his father&nbsp;
perform their traditional rituals. But there&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:42.840
is one scene from later on in the manga that&nbsp;
also showed us that his father could use the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:42.840 --> 00:16:48.900
overpowered ability Transparent World. This super&nbsp;
rare ability lets you see through someone’s skin&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:55.200
down to their muscles and bones. We know this&nbsp;
because in chapter 151 his sickly father easily&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:55.200 --> 00:17:00.660
killed a massive bear. His father then told&nbsp;
him that with enough practice his mind would&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:05.280
not need to think but he would just be able&nbsp;
react to what he was seeing. Unfortunately,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:05.280 --> 00:17:12.000
his father died from his illness a few days later,&nbsp;
and Tanjiro then inherited the hanafuda earrings.

00:17:12.000 --> 00:17:17.220
And as sad as it is to see Tanjiro lose his&nbsp;
father, at least he had a solid family for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:17.220 --> 00:17:24.480
most of his life. The same can’t be said for&nbsp;
Inosuke. At least, not a human family. Of course&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:29.280
he did have parents, but his mother fled with&nbsp;
baby Inosuke because his father was horribly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:29.280 --> 00:17:35.700
abusive. They eventually came to the twisted&nbsp;
cult who worshiped the Upper Moon two demon Doma,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:41.580
but when his mother realized that Doma was eating&nbsp;
people, she ran away once again. Unfortunately,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:48.000
Doma chased her and she was forced to throw baby&nbsp;
Inosuke into a river before Doma caught up and ate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:54.300
her. Eventually, Inosuke was found by boars, which&nbsp;
is how he grew up until he became a demon slayer.

00:17:54.300 --> 00:17:59.400
Which actually turned out pretty well for him,&nbsp;
but it all started with another deadbeat husband,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:59.400 --> 00:18:04.800
and I’m starting to think that they are just&nbsp;
as evil as the demons in this story. Another&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:04.800 --> 00:18:09.900
example of this is from the biwa demon’s backstory&nbsp;
from later on in the manga. That’s because when&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:14.520
she was a human she was a decent biwa player&nbsp;
who struggled to make much money. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:14.520 --> 00:18:18.660
her husband would gamble away even what&nbsp;
little money they had. And when he sold&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:23.760
her only nice kimono she got so furious&nbsp;
that she straight up killed him. But that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:23.760 --> 00:18:27.780
very same night when she went on stage&nbsp;
to perform, her musical performance was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:27.780 --> 00:18:32.460
so amazing that she actually continued&nbsp;
to commit murder every time she had a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:39.120
performance. This continued until she tried to&nbsp;
kill Muzan, but he then turned her into a demon.

00:18:39.120 --> 00:18:44.580
So again, who is the real evil&nbsp;
here, demons or awful husbands?

00:18:46.440 --> 00:18:52.260
Which just goes to show that good dads are&nbsp;
super rare, just like Tanjiro’s great ancestor,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:52.260 --> 00:18:58.260
Sumiyoshi Kamado. This man lived with his wife&nbsp;
Suyako and their daughter Sumire about 500&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:58.260 --> 00:19:03.000
years before the current story. This family&nbsp;
was actually attacked by demons and luckily&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:07.980
saved by the legendary swordsman Yoriichi,&nbsp;
who we’ll discuss in full detail in just a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:07.980 --> 00:19:13.680
moment. But this was a super important moment&nbsp;
for the story because Sumiyoshi became friends&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:13.680 --> 00:19:19.380
with Yoriichi and eventually the troubled&nbsp;
swordsman told Tanjiro’s ancestor his life&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:19.380 --> 00:19:25.140
story. AND THE MOST IMPORTANT PART was that&nbsp;
Yoriichi showing Sumiyoshi Sun Breathing,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:29.700
which is how it got passed down the&nbsp;
family line all the way to Tanjiro.

00:19:29.700 --> 00:19:35.820
But of course the original Sun Breather has&nbsp;
also one of THE MOST intense and complicated&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:35.820 --> 00:19:42.300
backstories in the entire story. This is Yoriichi&nbsp;
Tsugikuni who lived around 500 years ago. He is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:42.300 --> 00:19:47.760
literally the strongest demon slayer ever and was&nbsp;
the one who first created the breathing styles of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:47.760 --> 00:19:53.280
fighting. Yoriichi grew up with his twin brother&nbsp;
Michikatsu, and when they were growing up he was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:53.280 --> 00:19:58.740
a very quiet, kind child who took care of&nbsp;
his sick mother. However he literally did&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:58.740 --> 00:20:03.780
not speak at all as a kid, so his father was&nbsp;
going to send him to a temple. This is actually&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:03.780 --> 00:20:08.820
how he first got the hanafuda earrings because&nbsp;
his mother gave them to him because she hoped&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:08.820 --> 00:20:13.140
that they would help him to finally speak.&nbsp;
But everyone lost their minds when they saw&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:13.140 --> 00:20:18.360
him do this during sword practice. While his&nbsp;
brother struggled to even touch the instructor,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:18.360 --> 00:20:23.640
Yoriichi pciked up the practice sword for the&nbsp;
first time. He then instantly struck the teacher&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:23.640 --> 00:20:30.360
four times and left him with massive bumps and&nbsp;
bruises. Which left everyone mind blow, but the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:30.360 --> 00:20:36.300
excitement was short lived because Yoriichi didn’t&nbsp;
like the feeling of hitting someone, so he did not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:36.300 --> 00:20:41.580
pick up a weapon again while he lived at home.&nbsp;
But his legendary strength meant that his father&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:41.580 --> 00:20:46.320
instantly started to show him more affection.&nbsp;
He even decided to send his twin brother to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:46.320 --> 00:20:54.360
temple instead of Yoriichi. This of course made&nbsp;
his brother incredibly jealous, but Yoriichi’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:54.360 --> 00:20:59.820
super insane strength was not the only thing&nbsp;
that separated the two. Yoriichi was actually&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:59.820 --> 00:21:05.460
born with the demon slayer mark, which basically&nbsp;
makes a person much stronger, and he could even&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:11.040
naturally see the Transparent World, which was how&nbsp;
he knew his mother was sick when no one else did.

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:16.140
But when their mother finally died of her illness,&nbsp;
Yoriichi decided to leave home so that his brother&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:16.140 --> 00:21:21.900
would not be sent to the temple. After leaving, he&nbsp;
met his wife Uta, and years later they were about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:21.900 --> 00:21:29.160
to have a baby. But just like any happy thing in&nbsp;
these backstories, a demon came and messed it up.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:30.480 --> 00:21:36.660
While Yoriichi was going to get a midwife to help&nbsp;
his wife give birth, Uta was attacked and killed.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:36.660 --> 00:21:43.140
This drove Yoriichi to intense sadness, and he&nbsp;
even held his wife’s body for ten days straight.

00:21:43.740 --> 00:21:48.960
After this time of grieving he became a demon&nbsp;
slayer. Which was a completely game-changing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:48.960 --> 00:21:54.600
moment. Because of his natural talent, he taught&nbsp;
the other slayers everything that he knew,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:54.600 --> 00:22:00.480
which included adapting Sun Breathing into new&nbsp;
breathing styles to suit each individual person.

00:22:00.480 --> 00:22:05.880
Years later, Yoriichi encountered Muzan and&nbsp;
Tamayo, and while the demon king was a genuine&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:05.880 --> 00:22:11.340
threat, the legendary demon slayer instantly&nbsp;
defeated him and the demon only barely managed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:11.340 --> 00:22:18.180
to escape. Then Yoriichi let Tamayo go free,&nbsp;
but next we have the dumbest moment in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:18.180 --> 00:22:23.640
entire story. That’s because soon after this event&nbsp;
several other Demon slayers confronted Yoriichi&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:23.640 --> 00:22:28.080
amd kicked him out of the demon slayers&nbsp;
because his brother had become a demon,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:28.080 --> 00:22:32.460
which we’ll discuss more in just a&nbsp;
moment. Which is absolutely crazy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:32.460 --> 00:22:37.800
but is the reason he eventually went to&nbsp;
talk with Sumiyoshi Kamado about his life.

00:22:41.940 --> 00:22:46.080
Skipping ahead sixty years, Yoriichi&nbsp;
encountered with his demon brother&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:46.080 --> 00:22:49.860
one last time, but actually died&nbsp;
of old age during this battle.

00:22:49.860 --> 00:22:54.780
Which literally drove his brother mad with&nbsp;
rage. I mean how would you feel if you spent&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:54.780 --> 00:22:58.980
your whole life trying to beat your brother,&nbsp;
but then when you finally had a chance he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:58.980 --> 00:23:05.160
dies of old age… Talk about frustrating.&nbsp;
But despite everything his brother did,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:05.160 --> 00:23:09.900
Yoriichi still treasured a small flute that&nbsp;
his brother gave him when they were kids.

00:23:09.900 --> 00:23:17.040
But now let’s back up and talk about Michikatsu -&nbsp;
Yoriichi’s brother - because he goes on to become&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:17.040 --> 00:23:21.960
the Upper Moon One, Kokushibo. I just&nbsp;
explained about their shared childhood,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:21.960 --> 00:23:27.540
and how Michikatsu went from being the favored&nbsp;
child to the outcast, but once Yoriichi left,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:27.540 --> 00:23:32.400
Michikatsu eventually became the lord of his&nbsp;
family’s home. He married and had children,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:32.400 --> 00:23:37.200
but then one day a demon killed his soldiers&nbsp;
while they were out in the woods. Luckily,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:37.200 --> 00:23:42.480
Michikatsu was saved by Yoriichi, who was a demon&nbsp;
slayer at this point, and it was at this time&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:42.480 --> 00:23:47.940
that Michikatsu decided to leave everything&nbsp;
behind and become a demon slayer as well.

00:23:47.940 --> 00:23:54.540
He quickly learned his own breathing style -&nbsp;
Moon Breathing - and got his own demon slayer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:54.540 --> 00:23:59.700
mark. However, getting this mark was actually&nbsp;
the start of his downfall. Because every demon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:59.700 --> 00:24:06.240
slayer with the mark besides Yoriichi died before&nbsp;
their mid-twenties. So Michikatsu became obsessed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:06.240 --> 00:24:11.280
with survival and this eventually led him to&nbsp;
an encounter with Muzan. But because of his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:11.280 --> 00:24:16.920
intense desire to live, Michikatsu agreed to&nbsp;
become a demon and transformed into Kokushibo.

00:24:16.920 --> 00:24:22.620
Then after years of killing humans, including the&nbsp;
leader of the Demon Slayer Corps, Kokushibo became&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:22.620 --> 00:24:27.840
the upper moon one, and together with Muzan,&nbsp;
they wiped out every single demon slayer who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:27.840 --> 00:24:32.700
used the Sun Breathing style. But fast forward&nbsp;
sixty years, and Kokushibo only survived the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:32.700 --> 00:24:39.660
battle with Yoriichi because his brother died of&nbsp;
old age. This basically left him constantly angry&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:39.660 --> 00:24:44.400
at his brother, even though he ended up taking his&nbsp;
brother’s treausred flute and keeping it himself.

00:24:44.400 --> 00:24:47.100
But that’s actually not the end of his backstory,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:47.100 --> 00:24:51.420
because remember wife and kids he left&nbsp;
behind to become a demon slayer? Well,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:51.420 --> 00:24:58.920
that family actually were the past relatives of&nbsp;
the Mist Hashira, Muichiro Tokito. Which explains&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:58.920 --> 00:25:05.400
exactly why Muichiro was so naturally talented&nbsp;
because he was related to Kokushibo and Yoriichi.

00:25:05.400 --> 00:25:11.580
And while Muichiro eventually helped defeat&nbsp;
Kokushibo, he certainly wasn’t alone. Sanemi,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:11.580 --> 00:25:16.140
the Wind Hashira also took part in that&nbsp;
battle, and as we already explained with Genya,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:16.140 --> 00:25:21.600
he had the unfortunate task of killing his&nbsp;
mother who had transformed into a demon. But&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:21.600 --> 00:25:28.020
that isn’t the end of his sad story because roamed&nbsp;
around killing demons on his own he was found by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:28.020 --> 00:25:33.180
a demon slayer named Masachika, who brought&nbsp;
Sanemi to a demon slayer trainer so he could&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:33.180 --> 00:25:38.760
join the Corps. These two became basically like&nbsp;
brothers, but when they fought the lower rank one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:38.760 --> 00:25:42.900
demon, Masachika was killed in the battle. This&nbsp;
tragedy made Sanemi furious and he even snapped&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:42.900 --> 00:25:47.880
at the leader of the demon slayer corps before&nbsp;
reading his dead friend’s will calmed him down.

00:25:49.140 --> 00:25:54.660
Another of the participants in this legendary&nbsp;
battle is the strongest current demon slayer,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:54.660 --> 00:26:03.600
the Stone Hashira, Gyomei Himejima. And he also&nbsp;
has one of the wildest backstories. His mother&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:03.600 --> 00:26:09.900
died giving birth to him and his father died of&nbsp;
some illness. To make things worse, a fever caused&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:09.900 --> 00:26:15.600
him to go blind as a child. Eventually he was&nbsp;
living in a temple with a bunch of other orphaned&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:15.600 --> 00:26:21.600
kids. Things went terribly wrong though when one&nbsp;
of the kids led a demon right to them. The demon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:21.600 --> 00:26:26.820
killed most of the other kids, even though Gyomei&nbsp;
tried to save them. The only one who survived&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:26.820 --> 00:26:32.760
was the youngest girl who stayed behind Gyomei&nbsp;
while he punched the demon until the sun rose.

00:26:33.360 --> 00:26:38.880
Unfortunately, this is not a happy ending.&nbsp;
Because that little girl got confused and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:38.880 --> 00:26:43.680
actually started babbling that Gyomei was a&nbsp;
monster. This made people believe that Gyomei&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:43.680 --> 00:26:49.500
had killed the other kids and he was sentenced&nbsp;
to execution. Which is where he was headed until&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:49.500 --> 00:26:54.300
he was saved by the leader of the demon slayer&nbsp;
corps, who brought him to become a demon slayer.

00:26:54.300 --> 00:26:59.640
And all of that happened because of this slimy&nbsp;
kid right here. Kaigaku was living in the temple,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:59.640 --> 00:27:04.560
but was actually stealing their money. One night&nbsp;
he was caught by the other kids and forced out,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:04.560 --> 00:27:09.300
but then he ran into a demon. In order to save&nbsp;
his own life, he led the demon to the others,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:09.300 --> 00:27:15.420
which resulted in the tragic bloodbath. But that’s&nbsp;
not the end of his story because eventually he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:15.420 --> 00:27:21.060
was taken in by Jigoro, the former Thunder&nbsp;
Hashira, and trained alongside Zenitsu. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:22.560 --> 00:27:26.040
once he became a demon slayer, he ran&nbsp;
into Kokushibo and he chose to become a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:26.040 --> 00:27:32.220
demon instead of dying. Truly, he is one&nbsp;
of the worst people in the entire story.

00:27:32.220 --> 00:27:36.840
Which makes it crazy that he became&nbsp;
a demon slayer in the first place,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:36.840 --> 00:27:42.360
because usually Kagaya Ubuyashiki is really good&nbsp;
at understanding people. I mean he basically&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:42.360 --> 00:27:48.060
recruited all of the Hashira himself, and he&nbsp;
has earned all of their respect despite his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:48.060 --> 00:27:53.160
crippling illness. And if you didn’t know, that&nbsp;
illness runs through his family because of their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:53.160 --> 00:27:57.480
blood relation to Muzan. It’s basically a&nbsp;
curse that kills all the men before they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:57.480 --> 00:28:02.580
turn 30 and the women have to remarry and&nbsp;
change their name or they will die as well.

00:28:02.580 --> 00:28:08.640
Even Kagaya’s father killed himself when he&nbsp;
was just 19 because he couldn’t handle seeing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:08.640 --> 00:28:14.460
so many demon slayers constantly dying. This&nbsp;
left Kagaya in charge at only the age of 4,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:15.420 --> 00:28:23.220
which is absolutely insane. Then when he was&nbsp;
thirteen, his wife, Amane, was selected to marry&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:23.220 --> 00:28:29.820
him. Although he would only agree to marry her if&nbsp;
she actually wanted to. Which obviously she did&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:29.820 --> 00:28:35.280
and she later gave birth to the Quintuplets:&nbsp;
Hinaki, Nichika, Kiriya, Kuina, Kanata.

00:28:39.420 --> 00:28:45.720
But one thing Kagaya can’t do for himself is&nbsp;
fight, which is exactly the specialty of the Upper&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:45.720 --> 00:28:53.160
Moon three, Akaza. As a kid his dad was very sick.&nbsp;
They didn’t have any money so Akaza would steal to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:53.160 --> 00:28:58.260
pay for his father’s medicine. However, he was&nbsp;
caught, and his father then committed suicide&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:58.260 --> 00:29:06.960
because of shame. After this Akaza was banished&nbsp;
and he was eventually found by the leader of a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:06.960 --> 00:29:11.940
dojo. After living at the dojo for a few years,&nbsp;
Akaza became an incredibly strong fighter and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:11.940 --> 00:29:19.680
was even going to marry the leader’s daughter.&nbsp;
However, we can’t have a happy backstory so in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:19.680 --> 00:29:24.360
this case a jealous rival dojo leader poisoned&nbsp;
their drinking water. The dojo leader and his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:24.360 --> 00:29:29.520
daughter drank the poisoned water and died,&nbsp;
which sent Akaza into a rage and he literally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:29.520 --> 00:29:38.760
killed all sixty-seven members of the other dojo&nbsp;
with his bare hands. What an absolute monster.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:39.360 --> 00:29:45.180
And this display caught the attention of&nbsp;
Muzan, who then turned Akaza into a demon.

00:29:45.180 --> 00:29:50.400
Which of course came during his battle against&nbsp;
Tanjiro and Giyu. Speaking of the Water Hashira,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:50.400 --> 00:29:57.180
he grew up with his older sister, but one day&nbsp;
she sacrificed herself to protect him from a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:57.180 --> 00:30:03.090
demon. After this, he was sent away to a distant&nbsp;
relative, but he ran away instead. This almost&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:03.090 --> 00:30:09.420
turned out very bad though because he got lost&nbsp;
and nearly died on a mountain. He only survived&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:09.420 --> 00:30:15.420
because he was rescued and trained by Urokodaki,&nbsp;
which sent him on a path to become a demon slayer.

00:30:15.420 --> 00:30:20.280
Now we’ve already talked about the equally tragic&nbsp;
backstories of the Upper moon one and three,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:20.280 --> 00:30:25.680
but the Upper Moon 2, Doma’s childhood&nbsp;
was actually pretty easy in comparison.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:25.680 --> 00:30:30.420
He was born with extraordinary good looks&nbsp;
and for some reason people believed he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:30.420 --> 00:30:35.520
could communicate with the gods. So they&nbsp;
formed a cult with him as the leader,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:35.520 --> 00:30:39.240
even though Doma never believed any of&nbsp;
this. Then one day his mother killed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:39.240 --> 00:30:45.360
his father because he was cheating on him and&nbsp;
then she committed suicide. Doma didn’t really&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:45.360 --> 00:30:51.780
care about any of this, and at twenty years&nbsp;
old he was turned into a demon by Muzan. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:51.780 --> 00:30:56.700
still kept the cult going though, but now he&nbsp;
would eat the followers whenever he was hungry.

00:31:01.200 --> 00:31:09.060
This leads us to some of the most important&nbsp;
backstories in all of Demon Slayer. Starting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:09.060 --> 00:31:20.340
with Obanai Iguro who has maybe the most tragic&nbsp;
backstory in the entire story. Basically,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:20.340 --> 00:31:24.360
he was born to a clan of thieves who&nbsp;
worshiped a snake demon. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:24.360 --> 00:31:28.080
this clan almost never had male&nbsp;
children so&nbsp;the snake demon took&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:28.080 --> 00:31:32.760
a very special interest in him. They even&nbsp;
kept him locked in a cage for most of his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:32.760 --> 00:31:39.600
childhood and snake demon would watch&nbsp;
him late at night. Yikes. Super creepy.

00:31:41.760 --> 00:31:47.820
Years later when he was twelve he was let out of&nbsp;
the cage for the first time and he was immediately&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:47.820 --> 00:31:53.520
brought to the snake demon. And this was very,&nbsp;
very bad for Obanai because the snake ordered&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:53.520 --> 00:32:01.740
that his mouth be cut open kinda like the joker,&nbsp;
so that it matched the snake’s. After this Obanai&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:01.740 --> 00:32:09.007
was desperate to escape, and his only happiness&nbsp;
came from this little snake who became his friend.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:09.007 --> 00:32:09.720
Eventually he managed to cut his way out of his&nbsp;
cage with a stolen hair pin, and he ran away. When&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:09.720 --> 00:32:14.760
the snake demon found out she was furious and&nbsp;
killed nearly his entire family, before trying&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:14.760 --> 00:32:21.300
to recapture Obanai. Fortunately, he was saved&nbsp;
by the former flame hashira, Shinjuro Rengoku,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:21.300 --> 00:32:27.000
which led Obanai to join the demon slayers because&nbsp;
of his deep hatred for the demon. Interestingly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:27.000 --> 00:32:32.400
he also had a deep fear and hatred of women,&nbsp;
since his whole family that kept him locked up&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:32.400 --> 00:32:36.840
were women. Although it is implied that&nbsp;
he actually fell in love with Mitsuri,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:36.840 --> 00:32:43.980
and it turns out that she loved him as well, so at&nbsp;
least he got some small joy before they both died.

00:32:45.540 --> 00:32:51.360
Which brings us to another demon hater,&nbsp;
although this one is a demon herself. Tamayo,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:51.360 --> 00:32:57.660
who is the demon researching a cure to turn&nbsp;
Nezuko back into a human. But her story began&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:57.660 --> 00:33:04.800
over 500 years ago. When she was 19 she fell ill&nbsp;
and was desperate for a cure. She then met Muzan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:04.800 --> 00:33:11.580
who said he could cure her but he actually&nbsp;
just turned her into a demon instead. After her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:11.580 --> 00:33:17.220
transformation she mindlessly killed her husband&nbsp;
and children, which left her incredibly sad.

00:33:18.660 --> 00:33:24.180
At some point she even tried to kill Muzan, but&nbsp;
she failed and this basically broke her spirit.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:24.900 --> 00:33:29.880
She gave up and basically ended up serving Muzan&nbsp;
until she broke free from his control after the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:29.880 --> 00:33:34.200
fight with Yoriichi. From this point on, she&nbsp;
stopped killing people and eventually was able&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:34.200 --> 00:33:38.700
to live only by drinking blood, even though it&nbsp;
pained her not to eat people. Then over the next&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:38.700 --> 00:33:44.820
200 years, she learned enough medical science&nbsp;
to modify her body to not need to eat humans.

00:33:45.720 --> 00:33:52.860
Which of course brings us to the biggest demon&nbsp;
of them all, Muzan. And his backstory tells us&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:52.860 --> 00:33:58.860
exactly how demons actually came to&nbsp;
exist. Over one thousand years ago,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:58.860 --> 00:34:04.680
Muzan was a sick human who nearly died in his&nbsp;
mother’s womb. He was going to be cremated because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:04.680 --> 00:34:09.600
his family thought he was dead but they only&nbsp;
took him out of the fire when he finally cried&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:09.600 --> 00:34:15.600
out. Life did not get much better though because&nbsp;
his weak body kept getting worse. At some point&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:15.600 --> 00:34:21.840
he started an experimental treatment from this&nbsp;
random doctor, but Muzan was so frustrated that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:21.840 --> 00:34:27.720
it wasn’t working that he eventually killed the&nbsp;
doctor. Only then did he realize that the medicine&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:27.720 --> 00:34:34.560
was actually making him stronger, though in the&nbsp;
end it actually turned him into the first demon.

00:34:37.740 --> 00:34:43.320
From this time he started eating humans&nbsp;
and growing stronger, with his main goal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:43.320 --> 00:34:48.660
to overcome his weakness to the sun. He tried&nbsp;
to do this in two ways. First by finding the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:48.660 --> 00:34:53.280
Blue Spider Lily flower which was part of the&nbsp;
medicine he took, which he was never able to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:53.280 --> 00:34:59.040
accomplish. The second way was to constantly&nbsp;
make demons so that one day a demon might have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:59.040 --> 00:35:04.320
the power to resist the sun. But maybe the&nbsp;
most unexpected thing about Muzan was that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:04.320 --> 00:35:10.140
during his early years as a demon, he actually&nbsp;
settled down with a woman five times. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:10.140 --> 00:35:14.700
each of these relationships ended with his&nbsp;
wife committing suicide because he was an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:14.700 --> 00:35:24.060
abusive husband. Which definitely makes him the&nbsp;
worst of the worst. Demon and deadbeat husband.

00:35:25.980 --> 00:35:30.060
Over the centuries, he created the his Upper and&nbsp;
Lower moons by forcefully turning strong people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:30.060 --> 00:35:35.700
into demons. However, one strong fighter who&nbsp;
chose to die instead of becoming a demon was of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:35.700 --> 00:35:41.220
course the Flame Hashira, Kyoguro Rengoku. His&nbsp;
life ended after saving Tanjiro and the others&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:41.220 --> 00:35:45.420
during the Mugen train arc. And while I already&nbsp;
told you about his mom dying, another fact from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:45.420 --> 00:35:51.180
his past is that during his first mission&nbsp;
as a demon slayer, he actually ruptured his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:51.180 --> 00:35:57.600
own eardrums to overcome a Flute Demon’s special&nbsp;
abilities. Yikes, talk about dedication to killing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:57.600 --> 00:36:03.300
demons. Which is of course why he chose to die&nbsp;
instead of becoming a monster himself. But I’ve&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:36:03.300 --> 00:36:08.460
actually always wondered what might have happened&nbsp;
if he had actually chosen to live instead. Like,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:36:08.460 --> 00:36:14.760
would he become a GOOD demon or might he even have&nbsp;
the potential to become the strongest demon ever?&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:36:14.760 --> 00:36:19.620
Well, you can learn the answer to all these&nbsp;
questions by watching this video right here.

00:36:19.620 --> 00:36:21.900
Thanks for watching and I’ll&nbsp;
see you in the next one.

